### User Preferences Demo Requests
### Base URLs
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@token = your_user_bearer_token_here

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Happy Paths
### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1. Get Current User Preferences (Returns default merged values if empty)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/preferences
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Update User Preferences (Partial update - merges with existing keys)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user/preferences
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "locale": "pt_BR",
    "timezone": "America/Sao_Paulo",
    "color_scheme": "dark"
}

### 3. Update Individual Preference (e.g. only color_scheme to light)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user/preferences
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "color_scheme": "light"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Sad Paths
### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4. Sad Path: Unauthenticated Access (Expects 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/preferences
Accept: application/json

### 5. Sad Path: Invalid Timezone (Expects 422 Unprocessable Content)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user/preferences
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "timezone": "Invalid/Fake_Timezone"
}

### 6. Sad Path: Invalid Color Scheme (Expects 422 Unprocessable Content)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user/preferences
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "color_scheme": "invalid_color_theme"
}
